# ==============================================================================
# INVENTORY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM - ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION TEMPLATE
# Copy this file to .env and set your local MySQL database credentials.
# Note: The .env file is excluded from Git to prevent exposing credentials.
